00:32:50.400 --> 00:32:51.930
it's already protected.

00:32:51.930 --> 00:32:54.210
So we need security
at each layer,

00:32:54.210 --> 00:32:57.150
just to make sure
that we are having

00:32:57.150 --> 00:33:00.090
security controls at each layer,
